Known boundary (documented in shortsock.go): a windows host whose
%TEMP% exceeds 38 bytes (e.g. non-8.3 runneradmin paths on dev boxes)
keeps today's behavior (no shorter windows root is manufactured);
CI runners' RUNNER~1 8.3 form fits the 108 budget.
